MODULE: ViewConvergesFallOffMissesGap
TARGET: ViewConverges
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: fall-off is detected only when the trim runs two entries past the applied offset, so a one-entry gap wedges the drain
PERTURBS: FallOff

--- FIND
    /\ trim[bound] > applied
    /\ StartRebuild(bound)
--- REPLACE
    /\ trim[bound] > applied + 1
    /\ StartRebuild(bound)
--- END
